<title>FRANCE: UAP requotes at 134 Ffr.</title>
<headline>UAP requotes at 134 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French insurer UAP requoted at 134 francs after a brief limit down suspension, stock markets association SBF said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended at 135 francs after closing on November 8 at 116.9 francs.</p>
<p>The opening upper and lower limits for the share were recalculated for Thursday's trading due to the issuance of certificates of guaranteed value as part of its merger with Axa, a spokesman for the SBF said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
